<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-10-27T06:30:05.530Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 06:30:05 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen continue to target civilians in Plateau, killing a 60-year-old woman harvesting groundnuts and injuring two farmers, while Fulani attackers killed a farmer and wounded another. In Taraba, bandits have killed dozens of villagers, with reports of 52 bodies buried and later 58 bodies recovered from a market attack, and also struck near Sokoto University. Northern senators are demanding the arrest and prosecution of the perpetrators of the Taraba attacks. The conflict produced 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTnRKbF9zaV91aVhVa2paT1A3TTRBZFBsaThqenNjcVJYZFpJcVNGUVdybkVDZk81U2dEVENHekVZMUZjODBld3MtZnJfenhvWE9zSFlLMmM2UUdmVTdKMzhZTHRrTDU5NXFNdXowSXFiNUFkSklodjN5a2d6Rk0tTGl6UEtkcUMzOV9NalhRVFNJcC1RMjducjl1VmJNZHBjdlZNNThXTW9SMkJvbWljNkh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFA4UW9NSndxUVdNWUY0LWp6WFFuSVdWN011TmZ6LTM0Y0ljMTFrczhlOW8wdmw3aGo4aElJSW1RX2NwT0VZRHlrWk90Y1ZGVFRGMktial9Ycm4yVkU?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPb0d6UDlNblo0cHJ3Sl85VDcyS09yWGRuWXRmVjZTS1lZdnh1d19uSnFyWmE0SmwxZVRqcEM1a3psWm1LX2xnaVhmYmMyQUR6RnJkWk9obDRrVk1pWExfMTNBTFhKYkN5cTlWbmVPdk5PZHQxM2xjUno3WXlQbVV0M2pmZDFnTzZVVzlpWkYwWmJxU2tz?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPb1J4ZnFKQkVEMmNqNnhnQ1hzU290Wm5VWVI1ajhVUmpDbkpqLUlrNEVuckpONnNoN0hlZGJVTnhGY0V3dUh4UXFKUzN2ZFZSbk1fYWtEeUtMNDJRSVlfVDNjX1dWVWd2UzhlZFplZXA3d1l3dkdWLVRUMEhzd1RBcC1GRnRTQk8tNGNjc3B5RHZPcy1DOTlJeHp0Y3ZkdHhaX0xlTktJSWJlVDQ5b1hWQkpmb1ZrRC12RlNpTG5YekQ1Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt